OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 57, in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter e-scooter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 50s is in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital after falling
OL,8,Ffrom an e-scooter in the early hours of
OL,9,FThursday morning, police have said.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said two men had
OL,12,Fbeen travelling on an e-scooter on
OL,13,FChurch Cowley Road in Oxford between
OL,14,F00:42 and 00:54 BST when they fell.
OL,16,FOne of the men, aged 57, sustained a
OL,17,Fsignificant head injury and remains in
OL,18,Fa critical condition in hospital,
OL,19,Fwhilst a 22-year-old man suffered minor
OL,20,Fcuts and bruising, the force said.
