OL,4,Aafter e-scooter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the younger of the pair had
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of driving
OL,8,Fwhile over the prescribed alcohol limit
OL,9,Fand causing serious injury by careless
OL,10,Fdriving.
